          {
            "text": "Kaede of the Four Winds - A quick, laughing tengu who guards Wayfarer's Shrine and races travelers along the mountain paths. Mask off she seems an ordinary shrine-keeper; mask on, she is a blur of wind and steel.  (Can be befriended, rivaled, fought, or — if the story earns it — romanced.)",
