    {
      "userId": "0",
      "username": "Narrator",
      "text": "Here's how the demi-plane's regions map out on the current tile grid. I'll give you the coordinates as they're recorded.\n\n**The demi-plane regions and their map tiles:**\n\n- **Veiled Fox Sanctuary** — at grid tile **(−2, −11)**. This is where you are now. The northwest spirit-forest/shrine region. The **Hidden Estate of the Mother Fox** sits inside it (at its own local coordinates −6, −6).\n\n- **The Still Frontier** — tile **(−2, −12)**. Cold highland spirit-forest at the northwest edge — where the dimension's influence thins and expansion would begin.\n\n- **The Pale Reaches** — tile **(−1, −12)**. Misty white-stone highland badland. Largest reserve of undeveloped potential.\n\n- **The First Meadow** — tile **(−1, −11)**. Luminous wildflower meadow. Carries the Beginning's Torii at its northwest edge.\n\n- **The Quiet Shore** — tile **(−2, −10)**. Pale coast; the \"sea-less\" shoreline, still undecided between sea/desert/something else.\n\n- **The Westreach** — tile **(−1, −10)**. Open mixed grassland — the most practical construction-ready terrain, with marked sites for market square, guest house, and training yard.\n\nRelative to where you are (Veiled Fox Sanctuary at −2, −11):\n- **Westreach** is northeast (one step up-right)\n- **First Meadow** is east (one step right)\n- **Quiet Shore** is north (one step up)\n- **Still Frontier** is south (one step down)\n- **Pale Reaches** is southeast (one step down-right)\n\nThat's the full region list in the current data — there's no more granular \"map tile\" mapping beyond these region coordinates. If you want me to expand into a new tile (say, creating ocean, desert, or another named region somewhere), just say where and I'll add it.",
