      "realm": "Anime Fantasy",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "basicInfo": "The Kingdom of Dúnbheal rises from the northwestern mountains — a vertical kingdom of stone halls, volcanic forges, and elevator-pulley cities carved into cliff faces. The dwarves of Dúnbheal measure wealth in craftsmanship, not coin, and their Forge Lords rule by demonstrated mastery rather than birthright alone. The surface is a thin skin of trade towns and mountain passes; the real kingdom lies below, in vast underground halls where magma rivers light forges that never cool. Dwarven hospitality is warm but earned — outsiders are welcome in the surface towns, admitted to the deep halls only by invitation or proven trust. The kingdom exports weapons, armor, enchanted tools, and geothermal products that fetch premium prices across the continent.",
