      "hiddenInfo": "The village elder is a reincarnated hero from a previous age who has no interest in fighting anything ever again. She fishes, she drinks, she sleeps. If the Demon Lord's Army ever reaches this coast, she will be the last line of defense — and the first to wish it had not come to that.",
