      "name": "Obsidian Gates",
      "radius": 4,
      "region": "Dúnbheal",
      "x": 10,
      "y": -30,
      "basicInfo": "The fortified entrance to Dúnbheal's deepest levels — obsidian doors twenty feet tall, warded with every protection the Forge Lords possess, and guarded by sentinels who have not failed a shift in three centuries. The Gates are the last checkpoint before the Deep Court, and beyond that, the sealed passages to the Old City that no one is supposed to know about. The fortress around the gates is functional, imposing, and carries the implicit promise that whatever is down there, the dwarves are keeping it contained.",
