      "x": 13.249506914800833,
      "y": -4.703671619357506,
      "basicInfo": "A settlement that grew up adjacent to the citadel over generations — not planned, but accumulated. Demon merchants, craftspeople, information brokers, and the various service classes that a functioning fief requires. Also: visitors from other demon noble houses, cross-faction traders, and the occasional mortal who has found their way here through various means and decided staying was preferable to the journey back. The market runs on miasma-coin and barter. Information is a significant commodity.",
      "hiddenInfo": "The market administrator is a senior demon bureaucrat who has been running this longer than the previous three lords. They are loyal to the institution of the market, not to any individual ruler — which makes them more reliable than most, as long as you do not threaten the market itself.",
