      "y": 15,
      "basicInfo": "An abandoned watchtower in the northern Marches — once part of a chain of signal towers linking Solasreach to Caelvir, now a crumbling stone ruin overgrown with thorny vines. Adventurers use it as a landmark and occasional shelter; the top floor still offers a decent view of the surrounding hills. The tower is technically Solasreach territory but no one enforces that claim. The local bandits know it better than anyone and use it as a meeting point.",
