      "x": 28.893755415948608,
      "y": 21.106244584051392,
      "basicInfo": "The mortal-side territory adjacent to the Borderlands — frontier settlements, supply roads, minor noble estates, and the occasional dungeon-adjacent town that has grown up around an adventurer economy. This is where excursions operate. Raids are not random. Experienced demon commanders identify targets by resource value, defensive weakness, proximity to mortal military response, and political consequence. What raids bring back: food and material resources, gold, weapons and armour, intelligence on mortal military dispositions, and occasionally people — captives whose presence in the fief creates its own narrative weight. The narrator handles captive NPCs as full characters with their own perspective on their situation.",
