        "gateway-chamber": {
          "description": "The entry point — a circular chamber of pale stone with a standing arch at its centre. The arch is the door: when the creator uses Demi-Plane Gate, they appear here. When the Anchor opens a portal, it opens here. The chamber is the only part of the Demi-Plane that exists from the start. Everything else must be developed. The Chamberlain waits here when the creator is absent, maintaining the space.",
