        "the-clearing": {
          "description": "The blank canvas — an open expanse of flat ground stretching in every direction. The sky is pale and featureless. The ground is firm but bare — no grass, no trees, no water. This is the space that will become something. Every development the creator commissions will reshape part of this clearing into something alive. Right now it is potential. What it becomes depends on who builds it.",
