    "The Obsidian Citadel": {
      "areas": {
        "ancestral-vault": {
          "description": "The egg chamber — a sealed room beneath the east wing where the ancestral eggs incubate. Closed to non-family. The air is thick with old mana and something that might be memory. Your eggshell is still here, preserved by tradition or sentiment or the simple fact that no one has cleaned it up yet.",
