    "Skywatch Rise": {
      "name": "Skywatch Rise",
      "basicInfo": "The only rise in The Open Horizon — a low, broad swelling of ground a few meters higher than the plain around it. From its crest, the savanna unrolls to the glowing horizon in every direction, and the enormous sky feels larger still. Wild grass parts around its base as if in deference. At dusk the mana birds roost on its slopes, and their faint glow makes the rise look briefly like a low hill of embers.",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 10,
      "radius": 2,
      "region": "The Open Horizon",
      "complexityType": "simple",
      "detailType": "detailed",
      "known": true,
      "hiddenInfo": "The rise was not there when the region formed — it swelled up on its own some days after, as if the plain wanted one vantage point from which to see itself. Grass does not grow on its crest; the ground there is smooth and slightly warm, and sitting on it makes intention unusually clear. Whoever sits at the crest and looks at the horizon with a single fixed purpose may find the plain quietly rearranging itself to match.",
      "factions": [],
