      "radius": 4,
      "region": "The Low Reaches",
      "complexityType": "wilderness",
      "detailType": "basic",
      "known": true,
      "hiddenInfo": "The pools shift because the region is unspent potential in liquid form — each pool is the dimension briefly imagining being a lake. A visiting spirit salamander becomes, briefly, its shape. Objects dropped in the pools are carried by the channels; the marsh returns what it takes on its own schedule, sometimes years later and far from where it was lost. Mud sprites form where a pool dissolves the same hour another forms — brief, harmless, and curious about shoes.",
      "factions": [],
