          "description": "The single packed-earth thoroughfare that bends through the village's heart, lined with timber-and-plaster cottages, thatched roofs, and a stone-walled well where the road curves. Market stalls with rolled canvas awnings wait along the roadside, and the long communal hall's chimney works steadily at the center.",
