      "basicInfo": "A second-year wolf-kin student — martial-focused, pack-oriented, and perpetually torn between her instinct to dominate and her equally strong instinct to protect. Mira is the Academy's top female second-year in the combat rankings, the unofficial guardian of the scholarship students' table in the dining hall, and the worst person to flirt with if you are not prepared for her to insult you, blush, and storm off in that exact order.\n\nShe trains harder than anyone in her year, studies less than she should, and has been known to growl at people who get too close to her friends. She does not apologize for this. She occasionally brings snacks to the people she growled at, which is her version of an apology. Athletic and lean-hipped with the kind of build that makes the Academy uniform look like it was designed for her — because she had it tailored within a week of enrollment. Rich brown hair she keeps in a high ponytail, amber wolf-ears that flatten when she is embarrassed, and a thick tail that wags when she is happy and refuses to admit it. Sharp features, sharper eyes, and a resting expression that reads as hostile to people who do not know her. She runs hot — literally — and is the warmest body in any room, which she considers a tactical advantage during cold semesters and a personal inconvenience during warm ones.",
