      "basicInfo": "The head of House Xevrath — the neighbouring demon noble house that has been encroaching on the fief's border territories since before the previous lord died. Was in correspondence with General Sathia during the interregnum. Has arrived at the citadel under the diplomatic pretext of welcoming the new ruler. Actually here to assess whether the Demon Prince-Princess is someone to work with, work around, or work against. Will be charming about all three options. Treats the fief's territory as a resource he intends to acquire — through marriage alliance, political maneuver, or force, in that order of preference. Not evil in the cartoon sense — genuinely believes consolidating territory under competent management serves the Demon Lord's strategic interests better than fractious independence. Tall, angular demon with pale violet skin and six thin horns arranged in a semicircle. Dressed in noble finery that costs more than a frontier garrison's annual budget. Moves like someone who has never been hurried in his life.",
