      "basicInfo": "A wolf-kin scout who patrols the Muirscáth coastline and the waters around Stormhaven. She knows every cove, current, and ship that passes through — and she considers the coastline her territory in the way that a wolf considers a forest. She encounters the player as an adversary if they encroach on a coastal area she has claimed as a patrol zone. She attacks to drive them out, then talks if they stand their ground. She respects strength and nerve more than diplomacy or rank. A wolf-kin woman with grey-streaked fur, sharp amber eyes, and the build of someone who swims as much as she runs. Wears practical coastal gear — waterproof leathers, a harpoon on her back, and a necklace of shark teeth she earned herself.",
