      "basicInfo": "The matriarch of the Crossroads Inn — a retired A-rank adventurer in her late fifties who runs the inn with her husband Gan (also a retired A-rank). The inn is the only reliable shelter between Solasreach and Caelvir, and the couple has been operating it for twenty years. Rosa handles the common room, the meals, and the front-of-house. Gan handles security, the cellar, and the back rooms. They have raised three children at the inn, all of whom became adventurers themselves. Rosa is tall, sturdy-built, with grey-streaked auburn hair worn in a practical bun and warm hazel eyes that have seen everything and chosen to be kind anyway. She wears innkeeper aprons over sturdy travel clothes. Gan is a few inches taller, broad-shouldered, white-bearded, with arms like cordwood and a slight limp from an old injury. Together they radiate competence and welcome in equal measure.",
