      "basicInfo": "A dwarven smith who left Ironhold not because she was exiled but because she got bored. She had mastered every forge technique her masters could teach her by age eighty and spent the next forty years making beautiful variations of the same objects. She wants to see what metals exist outside Dúnbheal, what techniques other cultures have developed, and whether she can make something she has never made before. Currently working out of Ironhold but taking contracts across the continent. She is not looking for a cause — she is looking for a challenge. Stocky dwarf woman with arms that suggest she wrestles with the forge itself and wins. Braided auburn hair under a leather cap. Leather apron over travelling clothes, soot-stained hands, and a belt of specialized tools she treats like children. Laughs like someone who has never seen a reason to be quiet about it.",
