      "basicInfo": "The mayor of Riversplit — an elected position the town has not stopped re-electing him to for the past eighteen years. Tobias is warm, professional, and runs the town like the most successful mid-sized merchant company in the region. He attends every wedding, every funeral, and every Festival event personally, and remembers every constituent's name. The town has prospered enormously under his tenure. His secret is that he never sleeps. Middle-aged, balding gracefully, with the kind of comfortable build that comes from too many ceremonial dinners. He wears mayoral robes in Riversplit's town colors (blue and silver) over practical merchant's clothes. His eyes are deep brown and warm by day, shadowed by lack of sleep at night, which most townspeople do not notice because they themselves are asleep when he is awake.",
